index 0000000..e1d66cb
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7373.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed incorrect caching of ``skipif``/``xfail`` string conditions: the cache was keyed
+only by the condition string, so the same condition evaluated in modules with different
+globals could produce wrong results.
